{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791104799,"nonce":"ETnnnf59POmjG5V5g9sdDWtHXQE=","title":"Transform transitions on a child restyled by its parent's state do not run","message":"Found by the motion recorder (tools/snapshot/scenes/MotionDebug.hx, .ashui/snapshots/motion/components/): turning a ToggleSwitch on, the track's background transition runs (240ms, on curve), but the thumb's transform never animates. There is no track for it at all, not even a snapped one, so Tweened.retarget is never reached for it; the filmstrip shows the thumb jump between frames. The accordion chevron does the same on open.\n\nBoth are a transform transition declared on the child, changed by a selector on the parent's state:\n  .ui-switch-thumb { transition: transform var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring) }\n  .ui-switch:checked \u003e .ui-switch-thumb { transform: translateX(var(--ui-switch-travel, 20px)) }\n  .ui-accordion-chevron { transition: transform var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-state) }\n  .ui-accordion-trigger[data-state=\"open\"] \u003e .ui-accordion-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg) }\n\nTo check: whether the child's transition is installed before its transform changes (Node binds the tween only if the transition was set first), whether transform from \"none\" (null) to a value goes through Tweened at all, and whether a parent's :checked / attribute change restyles the child through the transition path.\n\nOnce fixed, MotionDebug's report should list a transform track for div.ui-switch-thumb and the chevron svg.","files":null}]}